    Foundation: Move Cocoa model values into the Foundation layer
    
    Move index collections, range values, formatters, predicates, sort descriptors and character sets behind the Foundation entry. Align formatter operations and remove legacy NSE exports. Keep custom model helpers internal and introduce a parent-aware AppKit tree node separately from controller snapshots.
